  m_text: 'HOW TO PLAY


    <b>CONTROLS:</b>

    WASD - Move

    Mouse - Look
    Around

    SPACE - Jump

    E - Interact

    TAB - Show Radar

    ESC - Pause
    Menu


    <b>OBJECTIVE:</b>

    Survive the night by defending your base from
    threats

    Manage oxygen when outside the bunker

    Repair systems during
    solar flares

    Hide in lockers when in danger


    <b>SYSTEMS:</b>

    Defense
    - Keep creatures at bay

    Power - Maintain bunker systems

    Oxygen - Essential
    for survival outside

    Radar - Monitor incoming threats


    <size=20>Press
    H to close this screen

    Press ESC to return to menu</size>'
